Z||000000||AkursedX||08-20-2000||11:13 PM||||If only I had a camera with me.....<P>I was on my way to take my girlfriend to dinner this evening and I saw the most unbelieveable sight. <BR> <BR>It was a riced out Chevy Cavalier.  Lowered, chrome rims, big exhaust tip, thumping system, the whole 9 yards.   That by itself is nothing special.  It's stuff we have all seen.  But what made this car special was the big V-TEC sticker that was on the side of his CAVALIER!!!!!   HOW STUPID CAN RICERS BE???  I was laughing so hard in my life.  <P>Hope this post managed to give everyone a little chuckle.  I just wish i had a camera.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000001||SCCA FIERO||08-21-2000||12:15 AM||||I saw a Noen at an autocross with a "Type-R" sticker on it... too funny. It was slammed and had a bunch of other stickers on it.<P>What was funny was his license plate surround said "I eat Mustangs and Camaros" (something like that). As I was walking by he was argueing about the class thay wanted to put him in because of his mods. He was saying that the class they wanted to put him in would put him in the class with a couple modded Mustangs and Camaros, and that wasn't fair. I could only laugh. Needless to say he got whipped bad.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Monkeyman||08-21-2000||01:59 AM||||The best part is the "big exhaust tip", not tip<B>s</B>.  The only vehicle I can think of that would have only one exhaust tip and still be fast would be a crotch rocket.<P>Speaking of Cavs, I had to drive my wifes '98 Cav to work tonight (the Grape Ape's finally getting new brakes).  I tried to take corners like I normally do.  Whew!  I thought I was gonna roll over.||||reg||1
