Z||000007||Patrick's Dad||08-22-2000||11:56 PM||||Also from the "I wish I had a camera" department....<P>Not far from my house this past weekend was a Toyota pickup with a cap over the bed. the truck was painted white with a flame job, and vertical pipes up the sides, behind the cab. I didn't see any air horns, though....<P>------------------<BR>This should work until my site comes online....   <IMG SRC="http://homestead.deja.com/user.rshuman/files/Tmh.jpg"> ||||reg||12
